msgid "Nexus platform documentation"
msgstr "Nexus 平台文档"

msgid ""
"Complete one task using the current reusable C11 platform. Product "
"applications, scheduling policy, private PCB data and recovery policy belong"
" in external consumer repositories. Source documentation, executed software "
"evidence and physical board qualification remain separate."
msgstr ""
"使用当前可复用的 C11 平台完成一项具体任务。产品应用、调度策略、私有 PCB "
"数据和恢复策略由外部消费工程维护。源码文档、已执行的软件证据和实板资格分别记录。"

msgid ""
"The current implementation uses generated typed factories and immutable C "
"interface faces. Factory lookup returns an existing static object; ordinary "
"I/O goes directly through its operations table. Startup does not start a "
"scheduler."
msgstr ""
"当前实现使用生成的类型化工厂和不可变的 C 接口接口面。factory 查找返回已有静态对象；日常 I/O "
"直接通过对象的操作表调用。平台启动不启动调度器。"
